### 密码登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "devcircle"
}

### GitHub OAuth2 mock 回调
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/oauth2/callback/github?code=demo-code&state=devcircle

### 混合推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=mixed&size=6
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 推理馆推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=deduction&size=6
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 科幻馆推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=sci_fi&size=6
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 宇宙档案推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=cosmos&size=6
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 推荐曝光
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/exposures
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postIds": [1001, 1003],
  "scene": "deduction_feed"
}

### 主题帖子列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?theme=DEDUCTION&contentKind=CASE_FILE&difficulty=HARD
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 创建推理案件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TEXT",
  "theme": "DEDUCTION",
  "contentKind": "CASE_FILE",
  "difficulty": "HARD",
  "solvable": true,
  "title": "雾港钟楼失踪案",
  "content": "凌晨零点钟声响起后，守夜人从封闭钟楼消失。",
  "tags": ["密室", "时间线", "海港"],
  "clues": "怀表停在 00:07；鞋印只到楼梯口；航海日志缺了一页",
  "solution": "守夜人藏在钟楼夹层"
}

### 提交推理答案
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deduction/cases/1001/answers
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "守夜人藏在钟楼夹层"
}

### 查看我的答题状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deduction/cases/1001/attempts/me
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 解谜排行榜
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deduction/leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 主题搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search/posts?keyword=钟楼&theme=DEDUCTION&contentKind=CASE_FILE&difficulty=HARD
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 上传媒体
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cover.png
--boundary--

### 点赞，带幂等键
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1001/like
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Idempotency-Key: like-1001-demo

### 收藏，带幂等键
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1001/favorite
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Idempotency-Key: favorite-1001-demo

### 关注用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/42/follow
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 重建搜索索引
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/admin/reindex
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 发布 Outbox 事件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/content/admin/outbox/publish?batchSize=100
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 审核列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audits/posts
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 审核通过
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audits/posts/1002/approve
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin
